  m_Name: NPC Orlan
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  lines:
  - "\u0110\xE3 v\u01B0\u1EE3t qua b\xE0i th\u1EED th\xE1ch c\u1EE7a ta, c\xF3 ti\u1EC1m
    n\u0103ng \u0111\xE2y."
  - "H\xE3y ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c \u0111\u1EBFn ng\u1ECDn n\xFAi cao nh\u1EA5t \u1EDF
    ph\xEDa b\u1EAFc, ng\u01B0\u01A1i s\u1EBD t\xECm \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EE9c
    m\u1EA1nh \u1EDF \u0111\xF3."
